  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "3 p2p-db Components Roles",
      "items": [
        "Msg Store = MVCC：消息 body 多版本历史；Index = EqIndex：收件箱/会话查询；Presence = DsFreeRing（本次新增 Set 语义）：在线 uid 集合"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Split Delivery",
      "items": [
        "Presence DsFreeRing.contains → WS 在线推；否则 APNs/FCM 系统推；两条路径互斥但共同覆盖 100% 用户场景"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Receipt Events",
      "items": [
        "Delivered/Read 都是独立 event；对 Alice 可见的双勾完全靠 receipts 事件，不靠服务端轮询"
      ]
    }
  ]
